## 5. THREE VERIFICATIONS — design §1.6's site list overcounts by three

- **`lib/capture/parse.ts:460` needs NO change, as predicted.** Its
  `found.kind === 'track'` is a `TokenKind` from the capture grammar (`#track` in
  typed text), a different union from `MindNodeKind` entirely. parse.ts is FROZEN
  and stays untouched.
- **`MapCapture.tsx:998` and `:1092` are the same `TokenKind`**, not the node
  kind — `KIND_SIGIL`/`KIND_LABEL` in that file are `Record<TokenKind, string>`.
  Neither is part of the audit. The design's 27 is therefore 24 real sites.
- **`MapBranch.tsx` needs no functional change.** `:224 trackIdOf` walks the path
  for `kind === 'track'` and finds it through a cohort; `:713 bandScope` sends a
  cohort to `path.find(kind === 'track')`, which is the right answer (a cohort
  has no `map_nodes` row for the band to read); `:657 entityIdOf(node)` already
  returns null for one by construction, so no org sidebar mounts on a cohort.
  `:398` is a comment. A one-line comment naming the cohort case at `:713` would
  be welcome and is not required.
